linou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T14:23:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T14:23:50Z","body":"I just managed to reproduce this on the same system as above on 4.4.1.stable. What I did was to move a 3D scene file (glTF) with an import error to the project folder, fix the import error somehow while the editor is unfocused, then focus back to the editor. I can still click to select nodes but can't use any dropdowns. Restarting the editor fixes the issue for now.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3052870916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082349081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103780#issuecomment-3082349081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103780","id":3082349081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63uOoZ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T03:42:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T03:42:43Z","body":"@Calinou Can you run the same test with a debugger and then dump the stack trace when things are stuck?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082349081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3084663439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103780#issuecomment-3084663439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103780","id":3084663439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc633DqP","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T16:18:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T16:18:25Z","body":"> [@Calinou](https://github.com/Calinou) Can you run the same test with a debugger and then dump the stack trace when things are stuck?\n\nI've tried to reproduce the issue by following the exact same steps, but I can't get it to happen anymore on either 4.4.1.stable or `master` 🙁 \n\nWhile trying to reproduce it, I got a crash but it's unrelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108712\n\nFor other people who can reproduce this issue, please try the following:\n\n- [Compile the `master` branch of Godot for macOS](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.html).\n- While in the Godot repository root, open a terminal and run `lldb bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64` (change this to follow the actual binary name if you've used specific SCons options that change it).\n- Enter the administrator password at the prompt, as lldb needs some elevated permissions to work.\n- Once you see `(lldb)`, enter this command: `run /path/to/project.godot` where `/path/to/project.godot` is the absolute path to your Godot project file (you can use `~` to refer to your home folder as a shortcut).\n- Run the editor until you run into the freezing issue.\n- Switch back to the terminal and press <kbd>Ctrl + C</kbd> (not <kbd>Cmd + C</kbd>). This will pause project execution, so the editor will appear frozen, but you'll see the `(lldb)` command line appear again. Enter `bt` in the lldb command line.\n- Post the backtrace here.\n- To resume execution, enter `c` in the lldb command line. I suggest taking a screenshot after resuming execution and attaching it here to add some context. Ideally, you could also record a video of the entire session to see what exactly caused the issue to start occurring (OBS can be used for this).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3084663439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3085193848","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103780#issuecomment-3085193848","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103780","id":3085193848,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc635FJ4","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T19:17:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T19:17:21Z","body":"Another easy macOS trick is to open the Activity Monitor and when it freezes, select the Godot process and then click **Sample Process**. Drop the spin dump here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3085193848/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3111415870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103780#issuecomment-3111415870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103780","id":3111415870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65dHA-","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T23:43:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T23:49:49Z","body":"> The editor will sometimes \"half-freeze\", where some things stop working, but others still do. \n\nI was able to observe these issues in the past as well (on MacMini M1), but I haven't noticed it in `Godot 4.5`. Perhaps it's been fixed now.\n\nCan you still reproduce it in Godot version `4.5 beta 3`?\n@KingSupernova31 @u1967076 @sebbasim @noahwagner04 @LanceLiang2011 \n\nwith `interface/editor/single_window_mode` = `disabled`\n\nhttps://godotengine.org/download/archive/\n\n\n---------\n\n\n<details><summary>video Godot 4.4.1</summary>\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9032ca5-ea6d-4c6b-999c-a328ee172f32\n\n</details>\n\nHere's a video showing how to reliably reproduce it in 4.4 and 4.4.1. Use the mouse to focus (hover) on the system buttons in the top left corner of the window. After that, the \"Godot buttons\" suddenly stop working in the Project Manager. It's also reproducible in the editor, but not for all input elements at once. \n\n---------\n\n> I found that if you change to \"Single Window Mode\" to On in \"Editor Settings\" all works as expected 🥳!\n\nAs soon as I activate `interface/editor/single_window_mode` this bug as shown in the video is no longer reproducible in Godot 4.4.1\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3111415870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3111555361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103780#issuecomment-3111555361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103780","id":3111555361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65dpEh","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-24T00:21:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-24T00:21:11Z","body":"<details><summary>10s video</summary>\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9032ca5-ea6d-4c6b-999c-a328ee172f32\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n**reproducible up to:** v4.5.dev3.official [28089c40c]\n**fixed in:** v4.5.dev4.official [209a446e3]\n\n\nhttps://godotengine.github.io/godot-interactive-changelog/#4.5-dev4\n\nmaybe a commit from `Input`\n\n> Input\n> - Fix FOCUS_ACCESSIBILITY grabbing focus when it is not supposed to, forward GraphNode key input to GraphEdit ([GH-105595](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105595)).\n> - macOS: Update entered state from mouseMoved ([GH-105822](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105822)).\n> - macOS: Embedded window support ([GH-105884](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105884)).\n> - Fix issues with Android controller input handling ([GH-105992](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105992)).\n> - Fix added missing shortcuts from tree to file list ([GH-105997](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105997)).\n> - macOS: Process first click event without requiring focus ([GH-106317](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106317)).\n> ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3111555361/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3115801057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103780#issuecomment-3115801057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103780","id":3115801057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65t1nh","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":